# Build before pushing main

Before `git push` of `main`, run `npm run build` from the repo root on the commit that will be pushed.

- Do not push `main` if the build fails.
- A typecheck-only pass is not a substitute. Vercel runs `npm run build`.
- Other branches do not require this gate unless the user asks.
